      "reading": "「ふとっているひとはみんなダイエットすべきだとおもう。」「あなた、わたしのことをいっているの。」",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "I think all fat people should go on a diet. Are you referring to me?",
          "html": "<span>I think all fat people should go on a diet. Are you referring to me? </span>",
          "segments": [
